#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: src/content/docs/download.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Download the Ditana GNU/Linux ISO with checksum and GPG signature verification."
msgstr "Telechargiar l’ISO da Ditana GNU/Linux cun verificaziun da la summa da controlla e da la signatura GPG."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: src/content/docs/download.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Download"
msgstr "Telechargiar"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/download.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ditana GNU/Linux {{release}}"
msgstr "Ditana GNU/Linux {{release}}"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/download.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| File                                                            | Purpose                                                                                  |\n"
"| --------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| [`{{iso}}`](https://ditana.org/downloads/{{iso}})               | The installation image (~{{iso-size}}).                                                  |\n"
"| [`{{iso}}.sha256`](https://ditana.org/downloads/{{iso}}.sha256) | SHA-256 checksum. Verifies that your download is intact.                                 |\n"
"| [`{{iso}}.sig`](https://ditana.org/downloads/{{iso}}.sig)       | Detached GPG signature. Verifies that the image is genuinely from the Ditana maintainer. |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Datoteca | Intent |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| [`{{iso}}`](https://ditana.org/downloads/{{iso}}) | Il maletg d’installaziun (~{{iso-size}}). |\n"
"| [`{{iso}}.sha256`](https://ditana.org/downloads/{{iso}}.sha256) | Summa da controlla SHA-256. Verifitgescha che Vossa telechargiada è intacta. |\n"
"| [`{{iso}}.sig`](https://ditana.org/downloads/{{iso}}.sig) | Signatura GPG separada. Verifitgescha ch’il maletg deriva effectivamain dal responsabel da Ditana. |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/download.md
msgid ""
"What changed in this release is described in the [{{release}} release notes]"
"({{notes}})."
msgstr ""
"Las midadas da questa versiun èn descrittas en las [remartgas davart la "
"versiun {{release}}]({{notes}})."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/download.md
msgid ""
"Media predating 0.9.4 can no longer install. The installer fetches its "
"configuration upon execution, and that configuration now names packages an "
"older medium’s package repository cannot deliver. Use the image above."
msgstr ""
"In medium d’installaziun pli vegl che 0.9.4 na po betg pli installar. "
"L’installatur telechargia sia configuraziun durant l’execuziun, e questa "
"configuraziun numna ussa pachets ch’il repositori da pachets d’in medium pli "
"vegl na po betg furnir. Utilisai il maletg qua survart."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/download.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Verifying your download"
msgstr "Verifitgar la telechargiada"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/content/docs/download.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1 — Check the SHA-256 sum"
msgstr "Pass 1 – Controllar la summa SHA-256"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: src/content/docs/download.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cd /path/to/your/downloads\n"
"sha256sum -c {{iso}}.sha256\n"
msgstr ""
"cd /path/to/your/downloads\n"
"sha256sum -c {{iso}}.sha256\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/download.md
msgid ""
"You should see `./{{iso}}: OK`. If this fails, the file is corrupted in "
"transit – re-download."
msgstr ""
"Vus stuessas vesair `./{{iso}}: OK`. Sche quai na reussescha betg, è la "
"datoteca vegnida donnegiada durant la transmissiun – telechargiai la "
"datoteca danovamain."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/content/docs/download.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2 — Verify the GPG signature"
msgstr "Pass 2 – Verifitgar la signatura GPG"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/download.md
msgid "The ISO is signed with the following key:"
msgstr "L’ISO è signà cun la suandanta clav:"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: src/content/docs/download.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Stefan Zipproth <s.zipproth@ditana.org>\n"
"Fingerprint: 3F80 54C3 FF75 5E55 44E6  8516 BC33 3E9A E877 D45A\n"
msgstr ""
"Stefan Zipproth <s.zipproth@ditana.org>\n"
"Fingerprint: 3F80 54C3 FF75 5E55 44E6  8516 BC33 3E9A E877 D45A\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/download.md
msgid "Fetch the public key from one of the public keyservers:"
msgstr "Telechargiai la clav publica d’in dals servers da clavs publics:"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: src/content/docs/download.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "gpg --keyserver hkps://keys.openpgp.org --recv-keys 3F8054C3FF755E5544E68516BC333E9AE877D45A\n"
msgstr "gpg --keyserver hkps://keys.openpgp.org --recv-keys 3F8054C3FF755E5544E68516BC333E9AE877D45A\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/download.md
msgid "Then verify:"
msgstr "Verifitgai lura:"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: src/content/docs/download.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "gpg --verify {{iso}}.sig {{iso}}\n"
msgstr "gpg --verify {{iso}}.sig {{iso}}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/download.md
msgid ""
"The signature is generated using a signing subkey of that key, so gpg "
"reports the subkey `068E EA2A 490B 0C63 AEAA 3BCD 3EC2 23A8 1107 7C09` on "
"the line preceding the result. That is expected: a subkey may be replaced "
"independently, without the fingerprint you verify against ever changing."
msgstr ""
"La signatura vegn generada cun ina clav secundara da signatura da questa "
"clav; perquai mussa gpg la clav secundara `068E EA2A 490B 0C63 AEAA 3BCD "
"3EC2 23A8 1107 7C09` en la lingia avant il resultat. Quai è previs: ina clav "
"secundara po vegnir remplazzada independentamain, senza che l’impronta, cun "
"la quala Vus faschais la verificaziun, sa midia insacura."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/download.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You should see `Good signature from \"Stefan Zipproth <s.zipproth@ditana.org>\"`. A warning that the key is not certified by a trusted signature is expected — it just means you haven't personally signed the key, which is normal.\n"
msgstr "Vus stuessas vesair `Good signature from \"Stefan Zipproth <s.zipproth@ditana.org>\"`. In avertiment che la clav n’è betg certifitgada cun ina signatura fidada è previs – quai munta mo che Vus n’avais betg signà persunalmain la clav, e quai è normal.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/download.md
msgid ""
"The same key is also distributed via the [`ditana-keyring`](https://"
"github.com/acrion/ditana-keyring) repository and pre-installed on every "
"Ditana system, where pacman uses it to verify packages from the Ditana "
"repository."
msgstr ""
"La medema clav vegn er distribuida tras il repositori [`ditana-keyring`]"
"(https://github.com/acrion/ditana-keyring) ed è installada ordavant sin "
"mintga sistem Ditana, nua che pacman l’utilisescha per verifitgar ils "
"pachets dal repositori da Ditana."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/download.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "Premissas"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/content/docs/download.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Stable internet connection"
msgstr "Connexiun stabila a l’internet"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/download.md
msgid ""
"Depending on what you select, the installer will download substantial "
"amounts of data. Some steps have retry logic, others do not — a stable LAN "
"connection (or a Wi-Fi device you configure during installation) is required."
msgstr ""
"Tenor quai che Vus tschernis, telechargia l’installatur grondas quantitads "
"da datas. Intgins pass han ina logica da repetiziun, auters betg – ina "
"connexiun LAN stabila (u in apparat Wi-Fi che Vus configurais durant "
"l’installaziun) è necessaria."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/content/docs/download.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Storage requirements"
msgstr "Spazi necessari sin il disc"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/download.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Configuration | During installation | Installed system |\n"
"| ------------- | ------------------- | ---------------- |\n"
"| Headless      | 18 GiB              | 5 GiB            |\n"
"| Desktop       | 45 GiB              | 13 GiB           |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Configuraziun | Durant l’installaziun | Sistem installà |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| Senza interfatscha grafica | 18 GiB | 5 GiB |\n"
"| Desktop | 45 GiB | 13 GiB |\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/download.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation procedure"
msgstr "Procedura d’installaziun"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: src/content/docs/download.md
msgid ""
"**Create a bootable USB stick.** Use [Etcher](https://etcher.balena.io), "
"[Ventoy](https://www.ventoy.net), or `dd` to write the ISO to a USB stick "
"(≥4 GB)."
msgstr ""
"**Crear in stick USB d’installaziun.** Utilisai [Etcher](https://"
"etcher.balena.io), [Ventoy](https://www.ventoy.net) u `dd` per scriver l’ISO "
"sin in stick USB (≥4 GB)."

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: src/content/docs/download.md
msgid ""
"**Reboot and enter UEFI/BIOS.** The key varies — `Del`, `F2`, `F12`, or "
"`Esc`, depending on your motherboard."
msgstr ""
"**Reaviar ed acceder a l’UEFI/BIOS.** La tasta variescha – `Del`, `F2`, "
"`F12` u `Esc`, tenor Vossa plattina principala."

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: src/content/docs/download.md
msgid ""
"**Disable Secure Boot and Fast Boot.** Both can interfere with the "
"installation. You can re-enable Secure Boot afterwards if you configure your "
"own keys."
msgstr ""
"**Deactivar Secure Boot e Fast Boot.** Quellas duas funcziuns pon disturbar "
"l’installaziun. Vus pudais activar puspè Secure Boot pli tard, sche Vus "
"configurais Vossas atgnas clavs."

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: src/content/docs/download.md
msgid ""
"**Boot from the USB stick.** Select \"Ditana GNU/Linux install medium\" and "
"press `Enter`."
msgstr ""
"**Aviar dal stick USB.** Tscherni «Ditana GNU/Linux install medium» e "
"squitschai `Enter`."

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#: src/content/docs/download.md
msgid ""
"**Troubleshooting (optional).** On some virtualization platforms (e.g. "
"Synology VMM), the boot can hang before the installer dialogs appear. This "
"is a [known kernel mode-setting issue](https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/"
"Kernel_mode_setting#Disabling_modesetting), unrelated to Ditana. Press `e` "
"at the boot menu, add `nomodeset` at the start of the kernel line, then "
"`Enter`."
msgstr ""
"**Schliar problems (facultativ).** Sin intginas plattafurmas da maschinas "
"virtualas (p.ex. Synology VMM) po l’aviar sa bloccar avant ch’ils dialogs da "
"l’installatur cumparian. Quai è in [problem enconuschent cun il kernel mode-"
"setting](https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/"
"Kernel_mode_setting#Disabling_modesetting) che n’ha nagut da far cun Ditana. "
"Squitschai `e` en il menu d’aviar, agiuntai `nomodeset` al cumenzament da la "
"lingia dal kernel e squitschai lura `Enter`."

#. type: Bullet: '6. '
#: src/content/docs/download.md
msgid ""
"**Follow the installer.** The dialogs guide you through partitioning, "
"bootloader setup, hardware configuration, and the four desktop environments. "
"Every dialog has a `Help` button with detailed documentation."
msgstr ""
"**Suandar l’installatur.** Ils dialogs As guidan tras il partiziunament, la "
"configuraziun dal bootloader, la configuraziun da la hardware ed ils quatter "
"sistems da desktop. Mintga dialog ha in buttun `Help` cun ina documentaziun "
"detagliada."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/download.md src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Unattended installation"
msgstr "Installaziun senza surveglianza"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/download.md
msgid ""
"No individual needs to be present at the keyboard. An answer file supplies "
"what the installer would normally request, and it is delivered to the medium "
"either on a small drive marked `DITANA_AUTO` holding `autoinstall.kdl`, or "
"via `ditana.autoinstall=` in the kernel command line, which also takes a "
"URL. The account password is given as a hash, never in plain text. See the "
"[documentation](https://github.com/acrion/ditana-installer/blob/main/docs/"
"unattended-installation.md) and the [server example](https://github.com/"
"acrion/ditana-installer/blob/main/examples/autoinstall-server.kdl)."
msgstr ""
"Nagina persuna na sto esser preschenta davant la tastatura. Ina datoteca da "
"respostas furnescha quai che l’installatur dumandass normalmain, ed ella "
"vegn furnida al medium: u sin in pitschen disc cun l’etichetta `DITANA_AUTO` "
"che cuntegna `autoinstall.kdl`, u cun `ditana.autoinstall=` en la lingia da "
"cumond dal kernel, che accepta er in URL. Il pled-clav da l’account vegn "
"inditgà sco hash, mai sco text betg criptà. Guardai la [documentaziun]"
"(https://github.com/acrion/ditana-installer/blob/main/docs/unattended-"
"installation.md) e [l’exempel per in server](https://github.com/acrion/"
"ditana-installer/blob/main/examples/autoinstall-server.kdl)."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/download.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "What to do if the installation fails"
msgstr "Tge far sche l’installaziun na reussescha betg"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/download.md
msgid ""
"The installer writes a complete log to `install_ditana.log` (directory "
"varies depending on installation phase). If something goes wrong:"
msgstr ""
"L’installatur scriva in protocol cumplet en `install_ditana.log` "
"(l’ordinatur variescha tenor la fasa da l’installaziun). Sch’insatge na "
"funcziuna betg:"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: src/content/docs/download.md
msgid ""
"Run `/root/folders/usr/lib/ditana/create-debug-user` from the live system "
"and follow the instructions to make the log retrievable."
msgstr ""
"Exequi `/root/folders/usr/lib/ditana/create-debug-user` en il sistem live e "
"suandai las instrucziuns per render accessibel il protocol."

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: src/content/docs/download.md
msgid ""
"Open an issue on [github.com/acrion/ditana-installer/issues](https://"
"github.com/acrion/ditana-installer/issues) and attach the log, or email it "
"to support@ditana.org."
msgstr ""
"Avri in issue sin [github.com/acrion/ditana-installer/issues](https://"
"github.com/acrion/ditana-installer/issues) ed agiuntai il protocol, u "
"tramettai il protocol per e-mail a support@ditana.org."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/download.md
msgid ""
"The installer is conservative — it tries to fail fast and loud rather than "
"continuing in an inconsistent state. Most failures are reproducible and "
"fixable."
msgstr ""
"L’installatur è conservativ – el emprova da fallar svelt ed evidentamain, "
"empè da cuntinuar en in stadi incoerent. La gronda part da las errurs sa "
"lascha reproducir e reparar."
